      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It **may** have something to do with the spherical culling function for cameras that was added in the latest SDK version (3.8.1). After I removed the spherical culling function from the script that handles the layer culling distance in the world it seems to have fixed the player chat bubbles from being invisible.",
